   PASS all 9 shapes (max_rel=0.000657..0.005578, max_abs=0.000001..0.000006, outliers=0)
   Identical numerical signature to accepted A-transpose baseline.

2) RESOURCES (NCU)
   registers/thread:         40 (same as accepted)
